# Command-line options that booc processes as part of every compilation,
# unless -noconfig is passed.
#
# The framework assemblies are referenced automatically: on .NET the old
# GAC names (System, System.Xml, System.Drawing) are empty type-forwarding
# facades, so booc references the runtime's real assemblies instead.
#
# Add -r: lines here for assemblies every compilation in this install needs.
